      "type": "text",
      "content": "# ⏳🏃 Future Perfect Continuous Tense\n\n> **فعل مستقبل مکمل جاری (مسلسل مستقبل بعید)**\n\n\n---\n\n### ✨ تعریف اور روزمرہ استعمال\n\nFuture Perfect Continuous Tense اُن کاموں کو ظاہر کرتا ہے جو مستقبل کے کسی وقت یا دوسرے عمل تک ایک خاص مدت سے جاری رہے ہوں گے۔ یہ بتاتا ہے کہ کوئی عمل مستقبل میں کسی مقررہ وقت تک کتنی دیر سے جاری رہے گا۔ اسے \"مستقبل مکمل جاری\" کہتے ہیں۔\n\n- ⚡ مستقبل کے وقت تک جاری عمل کی مدت: \"اگلے سال جون تک میں یہاں پانچ سال سے رہ رہا ہوں گا۔\" (By next June, I shall have been living here for five years)\n- ⚡ دوسرے مستقبل کے عمل تک جاری: \"جب تم واپس آؤ گے تو وہ دو گھنٹے سے پڑھ رہی ہوگی۔\" (When you return, she will have been studying for two hours)\n- ⚡ پاکستانی مثالیں: \"امّی شام 7 بجے تک تین گھنٹے سے بریانی بنا رہی ہوں گی۔\" , \"ابّا ریٹائرمنٹ تک 30 سال سے کام کر رہے ہوں گے۔\"\n- ⚡ اشارے: by (time), for (duration), since (point of time), when/before + present simple\n\n\n---\n\n### 📊 ساخت (Structure) — قاعدہ جات برائے Future Perfect Continuous\n\n\n| قسم (Type) | فارمولا (Formula) | مثال (Example) |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ✅ Positive | I/We + shall have been + V-ing Others + will have been + V-ing | I shall have been working for 3 hours. She will have been working for 3 hours. |\n| ❌ Negative | I/We + shall not have been + V-ing Others + will not have been + V-ing | We shall not have been waiting long. They will not have been waiting long. |\n| ❓ Interrogative | Shall/Will + Subject + have been + V-ing + ? | Shall I have been studying since morning? Will he have been studying since morning? |\n| ❓➕ Interrogative Negative | Shall/Will + Subject + not + have been + V-ing + ? | Shall we not have been living here for 5 years? Will they not have been living here for 5 years? |\n\n> 💡 **یاد دہانی:** 💡 یاد دہانی: Future Perfect Continuous میں shall have been / will have been + verb-ing استعمال ہوتا ہے۔ 🔹 I / We → shall have been | You, He, She, It, They, names → will have been 📌 For + مدت (for two hours, for five years) , Since + نقطۂ وقت (since morning, since 2020)\n\n\n---\n\n### 📌 مثالیں — مستقبل مکمل جاری جملے (دورانیہ کے ساتھ)\n\n#### ✅ Positive (مثبت)\n\n- 🇬🇧 **I shall have been teaching at this school for 10 years by next March.**\n- 🇬🇧 **We shall have been traveling for 12 hours by the time we reach Lahore.**\n- 🇬🇧 **She will have been cooking biryani for three hours by 7 PM.**\n\n#### ❌ Negative (منفی)\n\n- 🇬🇧 **I shall not have been sleeping for long when you call me.**\n- 🇬🇧 **They will not have been waiting for more than 10 minutes before the bus arrives.**\n\n#### ❓ Interrogative (سوالیہ)\n\n- 🇬🇧 **Shall I have been working here for five years by next month?**\n- 🇬🇧 **Will your father have been serving in this company for 20 years by 2025?**\n\n#### ❓➕ Interrogative Negative\n\n- 🇬🇧 **Shall we not have been studying Urdu for two years by the end of this course?**\n- 🇬🇧 **Won't they have been living in Karachi since 2018 when they move to Islamabad?**\n\n\n---\n\n### 🤝 فاعل اور معاون فعل (shall have been / will have been) کا رشتہ\n\n**فاعل اور معاون فعل کے جوڑے (Subject & Auxiliary Verb Pairing):**\n\n`📍 I → shall have been`  |  `📍 We → shall have been`  |  `📍 You → will have been`  |  `📍 He → will have been`  |  `📍 She → will have been`  |  `📍 It → will have been`  |  `📍 They → will have been`  |  `📍 علی / فاطمہ → will have been`\n\n> 💡 **اصول (Rule):** سنہری قاعدہ: Future Perfect Continuous Tense میں shall have been / will have been تمام فاعلوں کے لیے یکساں طور پر کام کرتا ہے۔ 🔸 ہمیشہ verb کی -ing form: working, eating, playing, studying, etc. 📌 for + مدت (for five years, for two hours) 📌 since + نقطۂ وقت (since 2015, since morning) 🔹 یاد رکھیں: time clause (by the time, when, before) میں future perfect continuous نہیں، present simple استعمال ہوتا ہے۔\n\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ عام غلطیاں — سیکھیں اور بہتر بنیں (Future Perfect Continuous)\n\n- ❌ **غلط:** `He shall have been working for 2 hours by then. (He کے ساتھ shall غلط)`\n  - ✅ **صحیح:** **He will have been working for 2 hours by then.**\n- ❌ **غلط:** `I will have been go to school for 5 years.`\n  - ✅ **صحیح:** **I shall have been going to school for 5 years.**\n- ❌ **غلط:** `She will have been cook for three hours.`\n  - ✅ **صحیح:** **She will have been cooking for three hours.**\n- ❌ **غلط:** `By the time you will arrive, I will have been waiting for an hour. (غلط - time clause میں future نہیں)`\n  - ✅ **صحیح:** **By the time you arrive, I will have been waiting for an hour.**\n- ❌ **غلط:** `I shall have been complete the project by tomorrow. (غلط - complete کی بجائے completing)`\n  - ✅ **صحیح:** **I shall have been completing the project by tomorrow. (لیکن یہ عجیب ہے) درست استعمال: I shall have completed... (یہ Future Perfect ہے)**\n- ❌ **غلط:** `Will not she have been teaching for 10 years by 2025? (غلط ترتیب)`\n  - ✅ **صحیح:** **Will she not have been teaching for 10 years by 2025? یا Won't she have been teaching for 10 years by 2025?**\n\n---\n\n### 📝 خالی جگہ پُر کریں — Fill in the Blank\n\nمشق کریں اور خالی جگہ پر صحیح شکل لگائیں:\n\n1. **Question:** She will **[ _______ ]** been studying for 6 hours.\n   - *ترجمہ:* وہ 6 گھنٹے سے ___ رہی ہوگی۔\n   - ✅ **صحیح جواب (Answer):** `have`\n\n2. **Question:** They will have **[ _______ ]** living here for 20 years.\n   - *ترجمہ:* وہ 20 سال سے یہاں ___ رہے ہوں گے۔\n   - ✅ **صحیح جواب (Answer):** `been`\n\n3. **Question:** I will have been **[ _______ ]** for a decade.\n   - *ترجمہ:* میں ایک دہائی سے ___ رہا ہوں گا۔\n   - ✅ **صحیح جواب (Answer):** `working`\n\n4. **Question:** **[ _______ ]** he have been driving for 4 hours?\n   - *ترجمہ:* کیا وہ 4 گھنٹے سے ___ رہا ہوگا؟\n   - ✅ **صحیح جواب (Answer):** `Will`\n\n5. **Question:** She will not have **[ _______ ]** sleeping well.\n   - *ترجمہ:* وہ اچھی طرح سو ___ نہیں رہی ہوگی۔\n   - ✅ **صحیح جواب (Answer):** `been`",
      "moduleId": "course-13-mod-3",
