      "duration": "20 mins",
      "type": "text",
      "content": "# 📋 Quick Reference Cheat Sheet — بارہ زمانوں کا خلاصہ\n\n> **پاکستانی طلباء کے لیے تمام 12 زمانوں کے فارمولے اور سنہری اشارے ایک ہی جگہ**\n\n---\n\n### 🟢 حال — Present Tenses\n\n| Tense (زمانہ) | ✅ Positive Formula | ❌ Negative Formula | ❓ Interrogative Formula | ⏰ Clue / اشارہ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **Present Indefinite** (حال سادہ) | `Subject + V1(+s/es) + Object` | `Sub + do/does + not + V1 + Obj` | `Do/Does + Sub + V1 + ?` | daily, always, every |\n| **Present Continuous** (حال جاری) | `Subject + is/am/are + V1+ing + Object` | `Sub + is/am/are + not + V+ing` | `Is/Am/Are + Sub + V+ing + ?` | now, at this moment |\n| **Present Perfect** (حال مکمل) | `Subject + has/have + V3 + Object` | `Sub + has/have + not + V3` | `Has/Have + Sub + V3 + ?` | just, already, ever, never |\n| **Present Perfect Continuous** (حال مکمل جاری) | `Subject + has/have + been + V+ing` | `Sub + has/have + not + been + V+ing` | `Has/Have + Sub + been + V+ing + ?` | since, for (ongoing) |\n\n---\n\n### 🟠 ماضی — Past Tenses\n\n| Tense (زمانہ) | ✅ Positive Formula | ❌ Negative Formula | ❓ Interrogative Formula | ⏰ Clue / اشارہ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **Past Indefinite** (ماضی سادہ) | `Subject + V2 + Object` | `Sub + did + not + V1 + Obj` | `Did + Sub + V1 + ?` | yesterday, last, ago |\n| **Past Continuous** (ماضی جاری) | `Subject + was/were + V+ing + Object` | `Sub + was/were + not + V+ing` | `Was/Were + Sub + V+ing + ?` | at that time, while, when |\n| **Past Perfect** (ماضی مکمل) | `Subject + had + V3 + Object` | `Sub + had + not + V3 + Obj` | `Had + Sub + V3 + ?` | before, already, by the time |\n| **Past Perfect Continuous** (ماضی مکمل جاری) | `Subject + had + been + V+ing` | `Sub + had + not + been + V+ing` | `Had + Sub + been + V+ing + ?` | since, for (before past event) |\n\n---\n\n### 🔵 مستقبل — Future Tenses\n\n| Tense (زمانہ) | ✅ Positive Formula | ❌ Negative Formula | ❓ Interrogative Formula | ⏰ Clue / اشارہ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **Future Indefinite** (مستقبل سادہ) | `Subject + will + V1 + Object` | `Sub + will + not + V1 + Obj` | `Will + Sub + V1 + ?` | tomorrow, next, soon |\n| **Future Continuous** (مستقبل جاری) | `Subject + will + be + V+ing` | `Sub + will + not + be + V+ing` | `Will + Sub + be + V+ing + ?` | at this time tomorrow |\n| **Future Perfect** (مستقبل مکمل) | `Subject + will + have + V3` | `Sub + will + not + have + V3` | `Will + Sub + have + V3 + ?` | by tomorrow, by the time |\n| **Future Perfect Continuous** (مستقبل مکمل جاری) | `Subject + will + have + been + V+ing` | `Sub + will + not + have + been + V+ing` | `Will + Sub + have + been + V+ing + ?` | for X hours by then |\n\n---\n\n### 🔑 3 Golden Rules for Tenses (تین سنہری اصول)\n\n1. **Continuous = -ing:** ہر Continuous ٹینس میں Verb کی `-ing` فارم آتی ہے، فرق صرف Helping Verb کا ہوتا ہے (is/am/are, was/were, will be)۔\n2. **Perfect = 3rd Form (V3):** ہر Perfect ٹینس میں فعل کی تیسری شکل (Past Participle) استعمال ہوتی ہے (has/have/had/will have)۔\n3. **Negative/Questions reset V1:** Present Indefinite (do/does) اور Past Indefinite (did) میں منفی اور سوالیہ بناتے وقت فعل ہمیشہ اپنی پہلی اصلی شکل (V1) میں واپس آ جاتا ہے۔\n",
      "moduleId": "course-13-mod-4",
      "moduleTitle": "Module 4: Synthesis, Cheat Sheet & Mastery Test"
